---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Pranav Magdum" description="Personal website of Pranav Magdum.">

	<!-- ============================================================
	     HERO — DeepMind × Atari
	     ============================================================ -->

	<section class="hero">
		<div class="hero-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
		<div class="hero-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>
		<div class="hero-content">
			<h2 class="hero-statement">
				What does a Machine See?
			</h2>
			<p class="hero-opener">
				Before I introduce myself, let me show you something I find fascinating.
			</p>
			<p class="hero-body">
				In 2013, DeepMind showed that an agent could learn to play Atari games
				using nothing but the pixels on the screen and the game score.
			</p>
			<p class="hero-body">
				It wasn't told what the game was or how to play it.
				It just had to figure it out.
			</p>
			<p class="hero-link">
				<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TmPfTpjtdgg" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Watch the agent learn &rarr;</a>
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- ============================================================
	     TRANSITION
	     ============================================================ -->

	<section class="intro-section">
		<div class="intro-inner">
			<h1 class="intro-name">Anyway, I'm <em>Pranav</em>.</h1>
			<p class="intro-text">
				I study physics and mathematics. I tend to follow interesting questions wherever they lead,
				even when the road turns out to be much longer than expected. You could say I am rather
				fond of adventures. The trouble is, as Bilbo would tell you, you never know where the
				road will take you.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
